% Ground abstraction of gk.js for the reference tool, written by hand from the
% extracted clauses. The tool declines the extraction, which has Skolem functions.
% typ = typical(the eating event); ranks 1 and 4 stand for the taxonomy
% priorities bear:1 and baby bear:4.
babybear.
bear :- babybear.
0.98::typ :- bear, unless(-typ, 1).
0.98::-typ :- babybear, unless(typ, 4).
query(typ).
